sequenceDiagram
    participant User as User / Dashboard
    participant API as kube-apiserver<br/>6443/TCP HTTPS
    participant MW as Mutating Webhook<br/>8443/TCP HTTPS
    participant VW as Validating Webhook<br/>8443/TCP HTTPS
    participant ODH as odh-notebook-controller<br/>watch event
    participant KF as kf-notebook-controller<br/>watch event
    participant GW as Gateway (Envoy)<br/>443/TCP HTTPS
    participant KRBAC as kube-rbac-proxy<br/>8443/TCP HTTPS
    participant NB as Notebook Container<br/>8888/TCP HTTP

    rect rgb(220, 240, 255)
        Note over User,KF: Flow 1: Notebook Creation
        User->>API: POST Notebook CR<br/>Auth: Bearer Token
        API->>MW: /mutate-notebook-v1<br/>TLS 1.2+, Admission Auth
        MW->>API: GET ImageStream (resolve digest)<br/>ServiceAccount Token
        API-->>MW: Image digest
        MW-->>API: Mutated Notebook<br/>(kube-rbac-proxy injected,<br/>reconciliation lock set,<br/>proxy env vars added)
        API->>VW: /validate-notebook-v1<br/>TLS 1.2+, Admission Auth
        VW-->>API: Admission allowed
        API->>ODH: Watch event: Notebook created<br/>ServiceAccount Token
        ODH->>API: Create ServiceAccount,<br/>NetworkPolicy, HTTPRoute,<br/>RoleBinding, ReferenceGrant<br/>TLS 1.2+
        API-->>ODH: Resources created
        ODH->>API: Remove reconciliation lock<br/>TLS 1.2+
        API->>KF: Watch event: lock removed<br/>ServiceAccount Token
        KF->>API: Create StatefulSet, Service<br/>TLS 1.2+
        API-->>KF: Resources created
    end

    rect rgb(220, 255, 220)
        Note over User,NB: Flow 2: Notebook Access (via Gateway)
        User->>GW: HTTPS request<br/>TLS 1.2+, Platform Auth
        GW->>KRBAC: HTTPS/8443<br/>TLS 1.2+, Bearer Token
        KRBAC->>API: TokenReview<br/>Verify user identity
        API-->>KRBAC: Token valid
        KRBAC->>NB: HTTP/8888<br/>Localhost trusted
        NB-->>KRBAC: Response
        KRBAC-->>GW: Response
        GW-->>User: HTTPS Response
    end
